            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Weathering Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, divine, transmutation)\n\n60 feet. The relictner radiates an aura of degradation. All objects in the area have their Hardness reduced by 10, to a minimum of 0, for as long as they remain in the aura and for 1 round after leaving it. The relictner can't deactivate this aura."
