              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nAs shadern immolator, except up to 12 rounds.\n\nDemolition 3A(divine, evocation) The relictner bellows in fury, causing the surrounding structure to collapse. All creatures in a 30-foot emanation take 8d10 bludgeoning damage from falling debris (31 basic Reflex save). A creature that fails its save is knocked prone.\n\nThe area becomes difficult terrain. The relictner can't use Demolition again for 1d4 rounds."
